        {
          "title": "Imajica",
          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Imajica is a commercial collectible/customizable card game based on Clive Barker's Imajica novel, published by Harper Prism in 1997."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The Imajica Customizable Card Game was released in August 1997, designed by Sean Curren and Hans Rueffert, with starter packages and booster packs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2-6 players use the table arrangement described for Imajica."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Commercial Imajica customizable card game decks and boosters"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Commercial Imajica customizable card game decks and boosters, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Commercial Imajica customizable card game decks and boosters and deal or lay out cards according to the documented Imajica rules before play begins."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
